  "markscheme": {
    "html": "<p>Correct answer: A</p>\n<p>A: Impulse equals area under the <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"F\"></span>–<span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"t\"></span> graph.<br/>Triangle with base <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"50\\,\\mathrm{ms}=0.050\\,\\mathrm{s}\"></span> and height <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"400\\,\\mathrm{N}\"></span>:<br/><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"J=\\tfrac{1}{2}\\times 0.050\\times 400=10\\,\\mathrm{N\\,s}\"></span>.</p>\n<p>B: This corresponds to taking the area as a rectangle <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"0.050\\times 400\"></span>, rather than the triangular area.</p>\n<p>C: This corresponds to halving the correct triangular area again (or using an incorrect base time).</p>\n<p>D: This corresponds to using <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"50\\,\\mathrm{ms}\"></span> as <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"0.0050\\,\\mathrm{s}\"></span> (incorrect conversion), giving <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\tfrac{1}{2}\\times 0.0050\\times 400=1.0\\,\\mathrm{N\\,s}\"></span>.</p>"
  },
  "paper": "paper_1a",
  "question": {
    "html": "<p>The graph shows the variation with time <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"t\"></span> of the net force <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"F\"></span> acting on an object of mass <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"0.20\\,\\mathrm{kg}\"></span>.</p>\n<p><figure data-asset-id=\"fig_01\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 1\" src=\"asset:fig_01\"/></figure></p>\n<p>What is the total impulse delivered to the object from <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"t=0\"></span> to <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"50\\,\\mathrm{ms}\"></span>?</p><ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"10\\,\\mathrm{N\\,s}\"></span></p></li><li data-label=\"B\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"20\\,\\mathrm{N\\,s}\"></span></p></li><li data-label=\"C\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"5.0\\,\\mathrm{N\\,s}\"></span></p></li><li data-label=\"D\"><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"1.0\\,\\mathrm{N\\,s}\"></span></p></li></ol>"
